{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48983","headline":"看牡丹二首 一 · 孙鲂","name":"看牡丹二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫将红粉比穠华，红粉那堪比此花。\n隔院闻香谁不惜，出栏呈艳自应夸。\n北方有态须倾国，西子能言亦丧家。\n输我一枝和晓露，真珠帘外向人斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙鲂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}